     1,
     "\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <p><font face=\"Noto Sans\">Very curious Prof Waltert.  It would\r\n        appear that your analyses did run because the Results Browser\r\n        contains density estimates and so forth.  Does the Results\r\n        window contain output?  I suspect it might, but you&#39;ll need to\r\n        open that window to be sure.</font></p>\r\n    <p><font face=\"Noto Sans\">If the Output window is also empty, check\r\n        under Tools | Preferences | General to investigate the\r\n        compressed format of output<br>\r\n      </font></p>\r\n    <p><font face=\"Noto Sans\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/distance-sampling/attach/aa1e30c36c42/mjhgdkieppnpfjpe.png?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\"><br>\r\n      </font></p>\r\n    <p><font face=\"Noto Sans\">The final remedy to apply is to install\r\n        the software into a folder other than the default directory. \r\n        That directory path contains a space &quot; &quot; that sometimes causes\r\n        difficulties.  Let me know what you discover.</font><br>\r\n      <font face=\"Noto Sans\"></font></p>\r\n    <div>On 07/12/2020 16:08, Waltert, Matthias\r\n      wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      \r\n      \r\n      \r\n      <div>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">I\r\n            reinstalled. This is how it looks.\r\n            <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n        <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><